When playing musical instruments to open the drawbridge, you have to
be standing on the one space that's right before the water that's
right before the drawbridge itself, or in other words, two spaces to
the left of the '#'. If you are playing on that space, you should hear
'tumblers click' and 'gears turn', or the drawbridge will open if you
got the tune right.

